      "description": "Sierra Petrovane is a Gobboc obsessive collector whose enthusiasm for old carnival drinks, bottle lore, mascot legends, and impossible promotional relics is somehow both adorable and deeply exhausting. At the Palevanna Watch Office, she works with the Nefaric Veil as a walking archive of prize codes, lost exhibits, corporate myths, and suspiciously valuable memorabilia. People dismiss her as harmless until they realize her trivia can unlock sealed rooms, expose fraud, and identify which relics were washed in ichor.",
      "settlementAndAncestryTexture": "Palevanna is a Town in Nalvessir, under Communalism, with low danger, Farming, Deep forest, Partial forest terrain. Local records favor Altruistic, Lawful, Cooperative, Honorable civic habits; common communities include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin. Gobboc reads through the Gobboc entry of the race compendium, within Orcs, Goblins, and Goblinoid Kin, marked by Enkirael. Gobbocs are brutish goblinoid variants known for extreme physical resilience and crude strength. They often serve as enforcers or shock troops in goblinoid societies. Table cues: Dexterity +2, Charisma/Wisdom +1, Coward's Creed, Feathered; starting tendency Selfish - Chaotic - Combative - Pragmatic.",
